+/*
+ * CortenMM arena management (EXPERIMENTAL, requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN).
+ * arg2 selects the operation, arg3/arg4 carry the address range and arg5
+ * must be 0.  DECLARE turns an existing MAP_NORESERVE private anonymous
